 "items": {
  "1": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Havo shari muallaq tursa ham Yer uni $mg$ kuch bilan tortadi. Bu kuchni havoning Arximed kuchi muvozanatlaydi, ammo og‘irlik kuchining o‘zi o‘zgarmaydi."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "F_{\\text{og'}}=mg"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** $mg$"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "2": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Grafikdan: 1–3 s da $x$ 25 m dan 10 m gacha kamayadi, 3–4 s da jism turadi, 4–6 s da $x$ 10 m dan 20 m gacha ortadi."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "s=15+0+10=25\\ \\text{m},\\qquad |\\Delta x|=|20-25|=5\\ \\text{m}"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\frac{s}{|\\Delta x|}=\\frac{25}{5}=5"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**D)** 5"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "3": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "$F_{\\text{ish}}=\\mu N$, ya’ni $\\mu$ — grafik qiyaligi. $N=40$ N da:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\mu_1=\\frac{20}{40}=0{,}5,\\qquad \\mu_2=\\frac{10}{40}=0{,}25\\;\\Rightarrow\\;\\mu_1=2\\mu_2"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** $\\mu_1=2\\mu_2$"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "4": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "v_{\\text{kv}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{3RT}{M}}\\;\\Rightarrow\\;\\frac{v_{H_2}}{v_{He}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{M_{He}}{M_{H_2}}}=\\sqrt{\\frac{4}{2}}=\\sqrt2"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**C)** Vodorodniki $\\sqrt2$ marta katta"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "5": [
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "h=\\frac{2\\sigma}{\\rho gr}\\;\\Rightarrow\\;h\\propto\\frac1g,\\qquad h_{\\text{Oy}}=6\\cdot15=90\\ \\text{mm}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 90 mm"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "6": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$\\varepsilon_1=6$ V, $\\varepsilon_2=2$ V, $r_1=r_2=0{,}5$ Ω, $R=3$ Ω"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Rasmda manbalar konturda bir-biriga qarshi ulangan (ikkalasining musbat qutbi bir tomonda), EYuK lar ayiriladi:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "I=\\frac{\\varepsilon_1-\\varepsilon_2}{R+r_1+r_2}=\\frac{6-2}{3+1}=1\\ \\text{A}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** 1 A"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "7": [
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Barcha zaryadlar markazdan bir xil $R$ masofada. Potensial skalyar kattalik, shuning uchun zaryadlar algebraik qo‘shiladi: $3\\cdot(+q)+5\\cdot(-q)=-2q$."
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\varphi=\\frac{k(-2q)}{R}=-\\frac{2kq}{R}"
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**A)** $-\\dfrac{2kq}{R}$"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "8": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Sterjen yuqori uchidan sharnirga mahkamlangan, uzunligining $1/5$ qismi suvda"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Sharnirga nisbatan momentlar qoidasi. Og‘irlik kuchi sterjen o‘rtasiga ($L/2$), Arximed kuchi suvdagi qism o‘rtasiga qo‘yilgan, u sharnirdan $L-\\frac{L}{10}=0{,}9L$ uzoqlikda. Ikkala kuch ham vertikal, yelkalardagi $\\sin\\alpha$ qisqaradi:"
   },
   {
    "t": "math",
    "tex": "\\rho SLg\\cdot\\frac L2=\\rho_sS\\frac L5g\\cdot0{,}9L\\;\\Rightarrow\\;\\rho=2\\cdot0{,}2\\cdot0{,}9\\,\\rho_s=0{,}36\\ \\text{g/cm}^3"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Umumiy holda: suvdagi qism $x$ bo‘lsa, $\\rho=\\rho_s(2x-x^2)$."
   },
   {
    "t": "status",
    "kind": "source_error",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Javoblar kalitida A) 0,25 berilgan edi. Momentlar qoidasi bo‘yicha to‘g‘ri javob 0,36 (B), kalit tuzatildi."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "t": "answer",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "**B)** 0,36 g/cm³"
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
  "9": [
   {
    "t": "given",
    "blocks": [
     {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "$C=10$ μF, $\\varepsilon=10$ V, $r=1$ Ω, $R=3$ Ω; kondensator bitta $R$ ga parallel"
